{"id": "34626", "title": "神曲", "author": "但丁", "category": "文学名著", "count": 100, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34626/34626s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34626.htm", "intro": "神曲(Commedia, Divine Comedy)，意大利诗人阿利盖利·但丁(Dante Alighieri, 公元1265-公元1321)的长诗。写于1307年至1321年，全诗为三部分《地狱》(Inferno, Hell)《炼狱》(Purgatorio, Purgatory)《天堂》(Paradiso, Paradise)，谴责教会的统治，但仍然未摆脱基督教神学的观点。 \r\n　　全诗共分三部，每部33篇，最前面增加一篇序诗，一共100篇。诗句是三行一段，连锁押韵（aba,bcb,cdc,……），各篇长短大致相等，每部也基本相等。（地狱4720行；炼狱4755行；天堂4758行），每部都以“群星”（stelle）一词结束。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34626", "chapters": [{"title": "第一卷 地狱篇", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "2206591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2206592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2206593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2206594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2206595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2206596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2206597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2206598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2206599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "2206600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "2206601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "2206602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "2206603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "2206604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "2206605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "2206606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "2206607.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "2206608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "2206609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "2206610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "2206611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "2206612.html", "availab